## 8. The Full RAG Pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph Offline["Pipeline (done ahead of time)"]
        Docs[Policy Documents] --> Chunk[Chunk: 500 chars, 50 overlap]
        Chunk --> Embed[Generate Embeddings]
        Embed --> Store[Load into Vector DB]
    end

    subgraph Runtime["At query time"]
        Query[User Query] --> Search[Search Vector DB]
        Search --> Chunks[Relevant Chunks Returned]
        Chunks --> Augment[Augment Prompt + Query]
        Augment --> LLM[LLM Generates Response]
    end

    Store -.available for.-> Search
```

**Key distinction:** ingestion (chunk → embed → store) happens *before* users ever ask a question. Retrieval (search → augment → generate) happens *at query time*. Conflating these two phases is a common beginner mistake.

